<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L2_3_3" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-03">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L2_3_3">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L2_3_3" name="3.3 Dewatering &amp; Product Handling (L2)" processRef="Process_L2_3_3"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L2_3_3" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L2 Process Area. Reduces moisture content of flotation concentrate from slurry (~40–60% solids w/w) to filter cake suitable for transport (typically 8–12% moisture for Cu; 6–10% for Zn/Pb depending on smelter specification). Separate dewatering trains run per concentrate type. Tailings are thickened and pumped to the TSF with process water recovered.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L2_3_3">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L2_3_3_conc" name="DCS Auto-control / Control Room Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L2_3_3_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Par_L2_3_3_f</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Par_L2_3_3_j</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L2_3_3_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L2_3_3_tail" name="Environmental Officer / DCS">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L2_3_3_s" name="Concentrate and tailings available">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:parallelGateway id="Par_L2_3_3_f" name="Fork">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_2</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:parallelGateway>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_1" name="3.3.1 Concentrate Thickening">
      <bpmn:documentation>L0/L1/L2 Process. Concentrate thickener(s) settle and compact the dilute flotation concentrate slurry by gravity sedimentation, aided by flocculant addition. Thickener underflow (high-density slurry, typically 55–70% solids) is pumped to the filter. Thickener overflow (clarified process water) is returned to the process water circuit. Separate thickeners are operated per concentrate type at polymetallic operations.
ISA-95 level: 0–2
Actors: DCS Auto-control; Control Room Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0–2; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 7
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: thickener_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_2" name="3.3.2 Concentrate Filtration">
      <bpmn:documentation>L0/L1/L2 Process. The filter (disc filter, pressure filter, or belt filter depending on site) removes the majority of remaining process water from the thickened concentrate slurry, producing a filter cake at the target moisture specification. Moisture content verification of the filter cake is mandatory — it is a commercial product specification and a P754 mass measurement requirement. Separate filters run per concentrate type.
ISA-95 level: 0–2
Actors: DCS Auto-control; Control Room Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0–2; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 5, 7, 8
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (concentrate_production_record — moisture attribute)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_3" name="3.3.3 Tailings Management">
      <bpmn:documentation>L0/L1/L2 Process. Flotation tailings (the mineral and gangue fraction not recovered as concentrate) are thickened, pumped, and deposited in the Tailings Storage Facility (TSF). Process water is recovered from the TSF and returned to the plant water circuit. Tailings represent the major waste stream of the plant and the closure of the plant-side mass balance.
ISA-95 level: 0–2
Actors: Control Room Operator; DCS; Environmental Officer
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0–2; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 5, 7
DDVC layer: Raw (time-series: tailings_telemetry)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:parallelGateway id="Par_L2_3_3_j" name="Join">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L2_3_3_7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:parallelGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L2_3_3_e" name="Filter cake in shed; tailings to TSF">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L2_3_3_7</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_1" sourceRef="Start_L2_3_3_s" targetRef="Par_L2_3_3_f"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_2" sourceRef="Par_L2_3_3_f" targetRef="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_3" sourceRef="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_1" targetRef="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_4" sourceRef="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_2" targetRef="Par_L2_3_3_j"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_5" sourceRef="Par_L2_3_3_f" targetRef="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_6" sourceRef="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_3" targetRef="Par_L2_3_3_j"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L2_3_3_7" sourceRef="Par_L2_3_3_j" targetRef="End_L2_3_3_e"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L2_3_3">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L2_3_3" bpmnElement="Collab_L2_3_3">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L2_3_3_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L2_3_3" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="922" height="340"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L2_3_3_conc_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L2_3_3_conc" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="882" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L2_3_3_tail_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L2_3_3_tail" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="190" width="882" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L2_3_3_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L2_3_3_s"><dc:Bounds x="110" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="88" y="139" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Par_L2_3_3_f_di" bpmnElement="Par_L2_3_3_f"><dc:Bounds x="202" y="70" width="70" height="70"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_1_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_1" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="308" y="57" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_2_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_2" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="514" y="57" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_3_di" bpmnElement="Sub_L2_3_3_3_3_3" isExpanded="false"><dc:Bounds x="514" y="227" width="170" height="96"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Par_L2_3_3_j_di" bpmnElement="Par_L2_3_3_j"><dc:Bounds x="720" y="70" width="70" height="70"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L2_3_3_e_di" bpmnElement="End_L2_3_3_e"><dc:Bounds x="826" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="804" y="139" width="100" height="56"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_1"><di:waypoint x="166" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="202" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_2"><di:waypoint x="272" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="308" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_3"><di:waypoint x="478" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="514" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_4"><di:waypoint x="684" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="720" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_5"><di:waypoint x="237" y="140"/><di:waypoint x="237" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="514" y="275"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_6"><di:waypoint x="684" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="755" y="275"/><di:waypoint x="755" y="140"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L2_3_3_7_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L2_3_3_7"><di:waypoint x="790" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="826" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
